! RT01 初期構成 (uRPF TS・昨日 anti-spoofing を導入した直後の状態)
interface Loopback0
 ip address 20.20.20.20 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description === Uplink-A: to ISP (RT02) ===
 ip address 10.72.204.1 255.255.255.252
 ip verify unicast source reachable-via any
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description === Uplink-B: to ISP (RT03) ===
 ip address 10.191.188.1 255.255.255.252
 ip verify unicast source reachable-via any
 no shutdown
!
router ospf 1
 router-id 20.20.20.20
 network 20.20.20.20 0.0.0.0 area 0
 network 10.72.204.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 10.191.188.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
!
